# `extras/` carries the systray app's sources, which the extension launches.
# Its build output and venv must not ride along: a .deb sitting in dist/ at
# packaging time would otherwise land inside the VSIX.
extras/**/dist/**
extras/**/build/**
extras/**/.build-venv/**
extras/**/__pycache__/**
